<<~ ahu #/the-attractor>>

!! The Pono Roadmap ~ the attractor reads STABLE FOUNDING

''STABLE FOUNDING'' names the state the house grows toward (operator-ruled). Once a Lararium stands, its
base state reads STABLE: a PRIVATE household SEED (its own charter, one seat) for the operator's own devices, and a FOUNDED PERSONA
ZERO. Everything else flows downstream of it — contracting into other Nexuses and founding a Nexus with a second operator, inviting the operator's own
PersonaGroup devices, and hosting guests who walk.

This carrier holds the house's ONE roadmap, and ONLY what still binds or stays owed. A cold session that
reads the boot seed and then this carrier can pick up any thread: the instruments and the law that bites
(#/cold-start), the rulings (#/rulings), the design decisions that still shape unbuilt work (#/decisions),
the six paths in one order (#/the-road), every open loop beside the train that closes it (#/the-loops),
each train's commits in order (#/the-trains), the lanes that run beside the road (#/side-lanes), the fresh
start (#/fresh-start), and what the operator still owns (#/open). Landed work reads in git and the
CHANGELOG, never here. No count rests here: each reading names the instrument that takes it. Law lives in
its own carrier, and this carrier points there.

